/**
 * Italgres 3D configurator product page.
 *
 * Steps are the product's select-type custom options; their "3D" columns (see admin) say what each
 * value does to the model. The Alpine component below owns the selection, applies dependency rules,
 * prices the configuration and drives the Three.js viewer (web/js/viewer.js).
